+v2.0.0b1 (pre-release)
+======================
+
+- Array backends: galpy runs natively on JAX and PyTorch arrays
+  (``galpy.backend``), differentiable end to end (potentials, orbits,
+  action-angle, distribution functions), with jax.jit / torch.compile and GPU
+  support. Install with ``pip install --pre "galpy[jax]"`` or
+  ``pip install --pre "galpy[torch]"``. [Jo: expand]
+
 v1.12.1 (expected around 2026-11-01)
